Yes. The **Project Scout & Selection Agent** is only one system. To make Atlas truly top-tier, Atlas needs a set of “operating systems” around learning quality, validation, personalization, portfolio evidence, cloud safety, hiring alignment, project scouting, measurement, selection, and quality control.

